<section class="section sideload-section" id="sideload">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-label">Installation</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">How to install on Android.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      KFit is distributed directly as an official signed APK. Sideloading gives you direct software access with zero intermediary store trackers.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sideload-grid">
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge">Step 1</div>
      <h3>Download the APK</h3>
      <p>Tap the download button above or grab the release asset directly from GitHub Releases.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge">Step 2</div>
      <h3>Open Downloaded File</h3>
      <p>When download completes, tap the notification or open the APK from your browser or Files app.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge">Step 3</div>
      <h3>Allow Installation</h3>
      <p>Android will prompt to allow installations from your browser. Toggle permission to continue.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-badge">Step 4</div>
      <h3>Start Tracking</h3>
      <p>Open KFit and immediately begin logging meals and workouts. No account creation required.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="security-callout">
    <div class="callout-icon">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="callout-body">
      <strong>Standard Android Security Prompt</strong>
      <p>
        Because KFit is installed directly without the Google Play Store, Android shows a standard warning about unknown sources. Every release is cryptographically signed and SHA-256 hashed. You can verify the checksum below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sideload-section {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .sideload-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px auto;
  }

  .step-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 28px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .step-badge {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--apple-blue);
    background: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.2);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .security-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .callout-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--card-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #30D158;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .callout-body strong {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .callout-body p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .step-card {
      padding: 20px 18px;
    }
    .security-callout {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
